hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1291","Muhammad bin Bashar told us, Abu Bakr, meaning the Hanafi, told us, Abd al-Hamid, meaning Ibn Ja`far, told us, on the authority of his father, on the authority of Mahmoud bin Labid, on the authority of Uthman ibn Affan, on the authority of the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, who said: “Whoever builds a mosque for God, God will build a house for him in Paradise.”"
